Algo Strategy Simulator — High-Level Architecture Plan (Java 11)

Companion to: Algo Strategy Simulator — Requirements, Scope & Business Outcomes v1.0
Constraint: Java 11; tick database replay handled by existing Java-based tick DB component
Design priority: Determinism over raw speed, realism over convenience

---

1. Architecture Overview

The simulator is a deterministic, event-driven pipeline that consumes historical events from the tick DB and produces evidence artifacts for Business, QA, and Dev. Every component is designed around three principles: reproducibility, realistic fill modeling, and auditability.

