6. Summary

The architecture is a deterministic, event-driven pipeline with six core components:

1. Tick DB Client — reads historical data (external, existing)
2. Event Sequencer — serializes all events into a single ordered stream (Disruptor-style)
3. Matching Engine — queue-aware, latency-modeled, halt-aware order matching
4. Algo Under Test — pluggable, pure, stateless-except-for-position
5. Event Log — append-only ground truth for every decision and outcome
6. Analysis & Reporting — metrics, detection, reconciliation, evidence generation

Everything is designed for Java 11 compatibility, determinism, and auditability. The tick DB provides the data; the simulator provides the realism; the event log provides the truth.

